@startuml task1_sequence
title Sequence Diagram for Task 1: Product Pricing (Decorator + Command)
autonumber

actor Client
participant "UI:Browser" as UI
participant "CheckoutController" as CC
participant "UpdTopCmd:UpdateToppingsCommand" as UTC
participant ":CommandInvoker" as CI
participant ":CheckoutService" as CS
participant "NewChain:PriceComponent" as PC
database DB

== Phase 1: Cập nhật Topping (Command Execution) ==
Client -> UI : Thay đổi số lượng topping & Submit
activate UI
UI -> CC : updateItemToppings(orderId, itemId, toppingsMap)
activate CC

CC -> UTC** : new UpdateToppingsCommand(cs, orderId, itemId, newMap)
CC -> CI : execute(cmd)
activate CI

CI -> UTC : execute()
activate UTC
UTC -> CS : getOrderedToppingQuantities(itemId)
activate CS
CS --> UTC : oldToppingMap
deactivate CS

UTC -> CS : updateToppings(orderId, itemId, newMap)
activate CS

CS -> DB : deleteByOrderItem(item)
CS -> DB : save(new OrderedTopping)
CS -> CS : calculateItemTotal(item)
activate CS
CS -> PC** : Build Decorator Chain (Base -> Promo -> Topping -> Qty)
CS -> PC : calculate()
PC --> CS : newTotal
CS -> DB : Update OrderItem total
deactivate CS

CS --> UTC : done
deactivate CS
UTC --> CI : done
deactivate UTC
CI --> CC : success
deactivate CI

CC --> UI : Redirect to /checkout
deactivate CC
UI --> Client : Hiển thị giá đã cập nhật
deactivate UI

== Phase 2: Hoàn tác (Undo) ==
Client -> UI : Click [Hoàn tác]
activate UI
UI -> CC : undo() [POST]
activate CC
CC -> CI : undo()
activate CI
CI -> UTC : undo()
activate UTC
UTC -> CS : updateToppings(orderId, itemId, oldMap)
activate CS
CS -> DB : Restore previous Toppings state
CS -> CS : calculateItemTotal(item)
CS --> UTC : done
deactivate CS
UTC --> CI : done
deactivate UTC
CI --> CC : success
deactivate CI
CC --> UI : Redirect to /checkout
deactivate CC
UI --> Client : Trạng thái & Giá quay về ban đầu
deactivate UI

@enduml
